   "daf": "22b",
   "sentenceId": 9,
   "he": "מַתְנִי׳ מַרְחִיקִין אֶת הַסּוּלָּם מִן הַשּׁוֹבָךְ אַרְבַּע אַמּוֹת, כְּדֵי שֶׁלֹּא תִּקְפּוֹץ הַנְּמִיָּיה. וְאֶת הַכּוֹתֶל מִן הַמַּזְחֵילָה אַרְבַּע אַמּוֹת, כְּדֵי שֶׁיְּהֵא זוֹקֵף אֶת הַסּוּלָּם.",
   "en": "«MISHNA:» «One must distance» his «ladder four cubits from» a neighbor’s «dovecote so that a mongoose will not» be able to «jump» from the ladder to the dovecote and devour the birds. «And» one must distance his «wall four cubits from a roof gutter, so that» the neighbor «can lean a ladder» in the empty space to clean and repair the gutter."
  }
